title: Political Rally
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: rally_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; rally_timer = 6 if next_election_time - time > 6 and not (year == 1936 and month == 2); rally_timer = 2 if (year == 1936 and month == 2) or (next_election_time - time <= 6)
max-visits: 36
count-visits-max: 36
frequency: 100
card-image: img/demonstration1.jpg

= Political Rally

Mass rallies are a common feature of political life in the Popular Front. What should be the theme of our rally?

- @unity
- @antifa_1
- @antifa_2
- @economic
- @pacifism
- @root: We do not wish to hold a rally right now.
- @easy_discard

@unity
title: For the unity and strength of the Popular Front!
on-arrival: popular_front_enthusiasm += 6*(1-dissent)

Our rally is a celebration of the Popular Front and the unity of the working and middle classes in defense of the <span style="color: #000091;">Republic</span>.

@antifa_1
title: Against domestic <span style="color: var(--nsdap);">fascism</span> and the <span style="color: var(--nsdap);">far</span>-<span style="color: var(--ppf);">right</span>!
on-arrival: {!
Q.antifascism += 4*(1-dissent);
Q.popular_front_enthusiasm += 4*(1-dissent);
if (Q.antifascism > 50) Q.workers_sfio += 3;
if (Q.antifascism > 50) Q.new_middle_sfio += 3;
!}

Our rally is an outcry against the <span style="color: var(--nsdap);">far</span>-<span style="color: var(--ppf);">right</span>, always a favorite theme of Popular Front rallies. [? if antifascism > 50:  Our consistent support of antifascism has rallied the workers and middle class to our side. ?]

@antifa_2
title: Against <span style="color: var(--nsdap);">fascism</span>, at home and abroad!
on-arrival: {!
Q.antifascism += 3*(1-dissent);
Q.popular_front_enthusiasm += 3*(1-dissent);
Q.confrontation_support += 5*(1-dissent);
Q.pacifist_dissent + 5*(1-dissent);
if (Q.antifascism > 50) Q.workers_sfio += 3;
if (Q.antifascism > 50) Q.new_middle_sfio += 3;
!}

Our rally is just as much against the <span style="color: var(--nsdap);">fascist</span> regimes in <span style="color: var(--nsdap);">Germany</span> and <span style="color: #008C45;">Italy</span> as it is against the <span style="color: var(--nsdap);">far</span>-<span style="color: var(--ppf);">right</span> movements in <span style="color: #000091;">France</span>.

@economic
title: For <span style="color: var(--sfio);">radical</span> economic change!
on-arrival: {!
Q.popular_front_enthusiasm += 3*(1-dissent);
Q.planism_support += 5*(1-dissent);
Q.socialization_support += 5*(1-dissent);
!}

Our rally is in support of <span style="color: var(--sfio);">radical</span> economic change, without any specifics as to the form of that <span style="color: var(--sfio);">radical</span> change.

@pacifism
title: For pacifism and against war!
on-arrival: {!
Q.popular_front_enthusiasm += 3*(1-dissent);
Q.pacifist_dissent -= 3*(1-dissent);
Q.pacifist_strength += 6*(1-dissent);
!}

Our rally is for pacifism and against war. This benefits the growing pacifist faction within the SFIO.
